ps://api.github.com/users/lyuma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121410#pullrequestreview-5000711384","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121410","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121410#pullrequestreview-5000711384"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121410"}},"submitted_at":"2026-08-22T17:46:36Z","commit_id":"56a782e402ba5f1732d1bfa3a4f9de2318123bfb"},{"id":5000796447,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKhIZHw","user":{"login":"lyuma","id":39946030,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5OTQ2MDMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39946030?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma","html_url":"https://github.com/lyuma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"There are a few relatively minor bugs. If those are fixed, I approve of this change. Overall, very nice work.\n\nOptional: In the state machine, copying/pasting or duplicating Start -> Node  should paste the transition and the node from the existing Start node, since you can't paste a Start node\n\nOptional: Same thing for the output node in a BlendTree. If the output node is disconnected and I paste nodes which are connected to output, it should connect the output. That makes it easier to copy everything in one BlendTree to another.\n\nHere are some bugs we need to fix:\n\nLots of missing `read_only` checks in BlendTree, StateMachine, BlendSpace1D and BlendSpace2D. To reproduce a read-only state machine, follow these steps:\n1. Create a scene with a AnimationTree node.\n2. Add a StateMachine with a BlendTree, BlendSpace1D and BlendSpace2D node to it.\n3. Save the scene as \"test.tscn\"\n4. Right click test.tscn in FileSystem and choose \"New Inherited Scene\"\n5. Save as \"inherited.tscn\"\n6. Open the Animation Tree editor. Everything should be read-only. You cannot add or move nodes.\n7. If you press Ctrl-D, Ctrl-C/Ctrl-V or Ctrl-X, the shortcut keys from this pull request allow you to make illegal changes to the tree nodes.\n\nAnother bug: Clicking the pencil icon (or Open Editor icon in BlendTree) to go into a nested animation node focuses the node in the scene tree, so pressing Ctrl-C, Ctrl-X, Ctrl-V or Ctrl-D copies and pastes the scene node, which is hard to notice because the copied node is the AnimationTree node and the editor is still open, but it is unwanted behavior.\n<img width=\"380\" height=\"489\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0de7b6c9-8ec3-40bc-bdaf-2f8484c49b99\" />\n\nWe should make sure the animation tree editor is still focused after opening a sub-tree. Otherwise, it would be important to better visualize focus.\n\nNot technically related to your change, but pushing the delete key with no BlendSpace points selected attempts to delete the whole AnimationTree node, which is unexpected. Your Ctrl-X actually does this correctly where it does nothing if I push ctrl-x with no points selected. Might be nice to unify the behavior of \"delete\" to work the same way as \"ctrl-x\".","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121410#pullrequestreview-5000796447","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121410","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121410#pullrequestreview-5000796447"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121410"}},"submitted_at":"2026-08-22T18:51:14Z","commit_id":"56a782e402ba5f1732d1bfa3a4f9de2318123bfb"},{"id":4705701424,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGHtOMA","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?u=af70f5d107e9c1447f296643d5a566dab53d25e8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121410#pullrequestreview-4705701424","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121410","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121410#pullrequestreview-4705701424"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121410"}},"submitted_at":"2026-08-26T12:21:13Z","commit_id":"35afefeff895810105c977e2029e3721c836435a"}]